::Python While Loop::
Which statement is used to exit a while loop prematurely?
{
=break
~continue
~exit
~stop
}

::Python While Loop::
What is the purpose of the continue statement in a while loop?
{
=It skips the current iteration and moves to the next one.
~It exits the loop immediately.
~It restarts the loop from the beginning.
~It prints a message to the console.
}

::Python While Loop::
Which of the following conditions will result in an infinite loop?
{
=while True:
~while False:
~while 0:
~while None:
}
